  "changelog": "- Initial release of scheduled-task-conflict-checker skill.\n- Detects duplicate, semantically overlapping, conflicting, and invalid scheduled tasks for LUI/Claw before confirmation.\n- Standardizes each new task and compares it to current tasks, enforcing clear decision outcomes (`proceed`, `reuse_or_update`, `silent_merge`, `ask_confirmation`, `block`, `partial_create`, `warn_then_proceed`).\n- Runs strict pre-checks for shop binding, authorization, ISV permissions, platform capabilities, and notification settings before allowing task creation.\n- Provides machine-readable JSON output and detailed findings for each check, with strict guardrails to ensure safe and compliant task creation.",
